+---
+features:
+  - |
+    Added ``before_sleep_metrics(client, name)``, which calls
+    ``client.incr(f"{name}.retry")`` before each sleep.
+upgrade:
+  - |
+    ``before_log``, ``after_log``, ``before_sleep_log`` and
+    ``before_sleep_metrics`` now catch exceptions raised by the logger or
+    metrics client and log them at debug level on the ``tenacity`` logger,
+    instead of letting them interfere with the retried call.
