@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    Added a ``stats_hook`` option to ``Retrying``, ``AsyncRetrying`` and
+    ``@retry``. It is called with the ``statistics`` dict after every attempt,
+    including the last one. Exceptions raised by the hook are logged at debug
+    level on the ``tenacity`` logger and ignored.
